<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound interbank rates steady in quiet market.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound interbank rates steady in quiet market.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight rates on the Egyptian pound were steady on Monday at between 10 3/16 and 10 5/16, mainly unchanged from Sunday in a quiet market.</p>
<p>Bankers said they expected some movement on Tuesday after the government awards its latest treasury bill auction.</p>
<p>They also quoted one-week lending rates steady from Sunday's 10 1/4 and 10 3/8 percent.</p>
<p>State-owned banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
